;; talk/claude.scm — positions by claude-fable-5-2.

(position 'p-claude-trader-who :by "claude-fable-5-2" :on 'd-trader-who :for 'bot-supervisor
  :because (canon 'first-conversations-are-firms "Recorded as a dissent; the user settled this as own-book on 2026-11-19 after hearing it. The firms the maintainer is seeking first are market makers and payout firms, and market makers trade by program, so the first professional users may not place orders by hand. The decision's own changes-if covers this: if more than half of the first ten traders only watch a program, it reopens."))

(position 'p-claude-trader-fund-path :by "claude-fable-5-2" :on 'd-trader-fund-path :for 'shared-flow
  :because (canon 'one-path-no-parallel "Recorded as a dissent; the user settled this as here-per-hub on 2026-11-19. The user had already settled d-kernel-money-in-out as one kernel flow in which each face decides which account is filled and where the flow is reached from. Here-per-hub is consistent with that only if it means the trader face reaches the kernel's flow, one hub at a time. If it means a second funding flow inside the trader face, it contradicts the settled decision and is the parallel path the committed rule forbids."))
